<Vertical id="chat_llm_interlude_demo">
  <Chat id="LlmInterludeChat" title="Tutoring Session">
title: Tutoring Session
cast:
  Kim:
    seed: kim_researcher
  tutor:
    seed: tutor_owl
~~~~

Kim: Before we move on, let's make sure the testing effect is clear.

Kim: Talk it through with the tutor — explain it in your own words.

>>> llm tutor [maxTurns=6]
  You are a friendly tutor helping a student articulate the testing
  effect (retrieval practice beats re-reading for retention). Ask one
  guiding question at a time. When the student states the idea correctly
  in their own words, congratulate them and say they can continue.

  The student's reflection so far: {{@reflection.value}}

Kim: Nice work. On to the next study!
  </Chat>
  <TextArea id="reflection" placeholder="Notes to yourself (the tutor can see these)" />
</Vertical>
